---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../lib/site';
---
<PageLayout
  title="Privacy"
  seoTitle="Privacy Notice for This Website"
  description="This website has no accounts, ads, analytics or tracking cookies. Photos you choose for Photo pairs stay in your browser and are never uploaded."
  path="/privacy/"
  crumb="Privacy"
  updated="2026-10-25"
  lede="The short version: we do not want your data. There are no accounts, no ads, no analytics and no tracking on this website."
>
  <p>This notice covers the website at {SITE.domain}. The Golden Moments mobile app has its own <a href={SITE.appPrivacyUrl} rel="noopener">app privacy policy</a>.</p>

  <h2>What we do not collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>No accounts, sign-ups, names or email addresses are needed to use the site.</li>
    <li>No advertising, analytics, session recording or social media tracking scripts are loaded.</li>
    <li>Our pages set no cookies. Our host, Cloudflare, may set a strictly necessary security cookie if it needs to check for automated traffic.</li>
    <li>Game choices and progress are not sent anywhere. They exist only in your browser tab.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Photos in Photo pairs</h2>
  <p>
    When you choose photos for <a href="/games/photo-pairs/">Photo pairs</a>, your browser reads them from your device
    and shows them on the page. The photos are not uploaded to us or to anyone else, and they are not saved. They are
    gone when you tap “Clear photos”, reload or close the page.
  </p>

  <h2>What stays in your browser</h2>
  <p>
    If you turn soft sounds on or off, the site remembers that one choice in your browser’s local storage so it is the
    same next time. It is never sent to us. You can clear it at any time by clearing this site’s data in your browser.
  </p>

  <h2>Hosting</h2>
  <p>
    The site is served by Cloudflare. Like any web host, Cloudflare processes technical information needed to deliver
    pages and protect the site from abuse, such as your IP address, browser type and the page requested. We do not
    add our own logging or analytics on top of this. Cloudflare’s handling is described in the
    <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" rel="noopener">Cloudflare privacy policy</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Links to other sites</h2>
  <p>
    Our guides link to sources such as government and charity websites, and to the App Store and Google Play. Those
    sites have their own privacy practices.
  </p>

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>This website is meant for adults and is not directed at children.</p>

  <h2>Changes and contact</h2>
  <p>
    If this notice changes, we will update the date at the top. Questions? Email
    <a href={`mailto:${SITE.supportEmail}`}>{SITE.supportEmail}</a>.
  </p>
</PageLayout>
